hyph-en-us.pat.txt and hyph-en-us.hyp.txt are American English hyphenation
patterns from the hyph-utf8 project (TeX Live), derived from Liang's patterns
(ushyphmax) by Gerard D. C. Kuiken.

Upstream: https://github.com/hyphenation/tex-hyphen
